Package: tind-ai
Version: 0.1.0~test1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: tind-ai-users, tind-ai-local, tind-ai-remote, tind-ai-ui
Installed-Size: 24
Description: Tind AI box (installed from the AI assistant box in Tind Apps)
 An AI assistant built into the desktop, behind walls: a local service that
 reads and redacts but has no network, a remote service per provider that sends
 only what the human approved and reads nothing else, and the Ask window on
 Super+K. European providers are the default; Claude and ChatGPT are options.
